        "name": "rampart-20x-playground reporting page v0.1.0",
        "description": "The /playground/reporting page (Reporting): two report panels of compliance_core, the agency part and, below the cut line, the internal part, each linked to the Searches its lines read; the report Searches they add; and one report deadlines Search over vdr-summary of fedramp_20x_vdr (the four deadline counts, worst-case bound). See req-rampart-20x-playground-page-reporting."
      },
